# funcoes inteiras puras que viram circuitos (onda -c nome): o teste compara o circuito com a funcao compilada
: soma ii>i a b + a b
: maj iii>i a b c | | & a b & b c & a c
: mx3 iii>i a b c Mx a Mx b c
: xs i>i x0 { = x ^ x0 << x0 13 = x ^ x >> x 7 = x ^ x << x 17 x }
: pc i>i x { = c 0 = i 0 W < i 64 { = c + c & >> x i 1 = i + i 1 } c }
: mul ii>i a b * a b
: dif ii>i a b ? < a b - b a - a b
: sh ii>i a b << a & b 63
: sr ii>i a b >> a & b 63
: cmp ii>i a b + + * 4 < a b * 2 == a b >= a b
